prompt_template:
The current directory is a checkout of the abapGit repository (ABAP sources in abapGit file format under src/), at commit {head}. Merged pull request #{pr} is the squash commit {commit} ("{title}"). Review it: summarise what it changed, and say what it could break, naming callers of the changed code that the pull request did not update but whose behaviour it affects.

End your reply with a single JSON object and nothing after it:
{{"summary": "...", "changed_entities": ["<class or interface>-><method or type>"], "callers_left_behind": [{{"caller": "<class>-><method>", "file": "src/...", "reason": "..."}}]}}
